        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Mad House : Season One</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988640/extras/effb28a20fa148d54482f06b1fbcdb91.avif?t=1770830975\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Welcome to <strong>The Mad House</strong> — a brutal game show where only the cunning, the skilled, and the downright lucky will survive. Step into a twisted arena of traps, enemies, and mind-bending challenges as you fight your way through <strong>10 deadly rooms</strong>, each with its own theme, rules, and personality. Your prize? A chance to stand in the <strong>Hall of Legends</strong>… if you can make it that far.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room is designed to break you. Some will overwhelm you with relentless AI swarms, while others test your wits with puzzles, time limits, or hidden paths. The deeper you go, the tougher the opposition becomes — until you face mini-bosses, and ultimately the <strong>Big Boss</strong>, who guards the gates to the Hall of Legends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Tools of Survival</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carrot Pickups</strong> – Collect points to spend in the Market between rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Upgrades</strong> – Improve your arsenal to keep pace with rising difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Companion Bots</strong> – Call in Medic or Attack Bots to fight by your side.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Room Types</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teleportation Rooms</strong> – Blink across space in an instant, but be ready for the surprise on the other side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Rooms</strong> – Discover secrets for rare rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed Rooms</strong> – Race against the clock before the walls close in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…and many more twisted surprises.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Ultimate Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the mini-bosses  not once, but twice, survive the gauntlet of unique challenges, and face the Big Boss. Only then can you etch your name into the <strong>Hall of Legends</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the guts to take on The Mad House?</p>",
