e surprise on the other side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Rooms</strong> – Discover secrets for rare rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed Rooms</strong> – Race against the clock before the walls close in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…and many more twisted surprises.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Ultimate Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the mini-bosses  not once, but twice, survive the gauntlet of unique challenges, and face the Big Boss. Only then can you etch your name into the <strong>Hall of Legends</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the guts to take on The Mad House?</p>",
